<header role="banner">
  <div class="nav-in">
    <a class="lb-brand" href="#top" aria-label="FAY'S SOLUTIONS - Home" style="--lb-disp:Roboto Slab;--lb-sub:Inter;--lb-acc:#243c54;"><span class="lb-brand__word"><span class="lb-brand__name">FAY'S SOLUTIONS</span><span class="lb-brand__sub"><span class="lb-acc">—</span> THE SHRINK WRAP SPECIALISTS —</span><span class="lb-brand__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#lbq">Get a Quote</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main id="main-content">
<section class="section hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="tag">Scaffold Encapsulation &amp; Site Containment</span>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Scaffold up.<br>Wrap tensioned.<br><em>Sealed tight.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Compliant weatherproof containment for builders and scaffolders across Sydney. Shrink-wrap systems that seal tight, shed water, and meet site safety requirements.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#lbq">Request a Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost hero-ghost" href="tel:+61478770099">Call 0478 770 099</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title" style="background:var(--card);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="container">
    <header style="margin-bottom:32px">
      <span class="tag">What we do</span>
      <h2 id="services-title">Scaffold encapsulation & site containment</h2>
      <p>Compliant weatherproof containment for builders and scaffolders across Sydney. Shrink-wrap systems that seal tight, shed water, and meet site safety requirements.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:8px">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Core service</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Scaffold encapsulation</h3>
        <p>Full scaffold wrap systems - sheeted, tensioned, and sealed bay by bay. Sheeted, tensioned and sealed bay by bay to suit your scaffold.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Core service</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Site containment</h3>
        <p>Perimeter containment, debris netting, and dust control screens. Keeps sites compliant and neighbours happy.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Specialist</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Shrink wrap weatherproofing</h3>
        <p>Heat-shrunk membrane systems for roofs, openings, and temporary enclosures. Watertight, durable, fast to install.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Compliance</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Compliant containment for builders</h3>
        <p>Systems that satisfy NSW SafeWork and principal contractor requirements. Documentation and certification on request.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
